Package: nmeweibull
Title: The New Modified Exponential-Weibull Distribution for Survival Time
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Tan", "Azza Nuro Azzikra", , "222212894@stis.ac.id", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Density, distribution, survival, hazard, quantile, and random
    generation functions for the New Modified Exponential-Weibull
    (NME-Weibull) distribution of Alshanbari et al. (2023)
    <doi:10.3390/axioms12050477>, together with maximum likelihood
    estimation for complete survival-time data and the quantile-based risk
    measures Value-at-Risk, Tail Value-at-Risk, and Range Value-at-Risk.
